id: persona-wear
section: Personas and add-ons
item: From about:personas' site section: Wear asks first and names the site, OK wears it; Undo in the message takes it off (the engine's lightweightThemes prefs say so)
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: about:personas
kit: cavekit-personas-ui.md R6
needs: internet
wait rect 'sel:#online .card button' 60
calibrate 'sel:.group-title'
tap 'sel:#online .card button'
expect dialog present 8
chrome dialog-ok
expect dialog answered 8
wait text status-text Wearing 8
wait pref b lightweightThemes.isThemeSelected true 6
tap status-undo
wait text status-text Undone 8
wait pref b lightweightThemes.isThemeSelected false 6
